# Development only: never ship this addon. See docs/BENCHMARKS.md, "In-client runner".
#
# The harness depends on no framework addon on purpose: the Kits and Ace3 are
# each in a load-on-demand side addon (MoltenCodesBench_Kits,
# MoltenCodesBench_Ace3) that the harness loads, one per session.
#
# Installation.lua and the modules/ folder are written here by
# `python3 -m tooling.bench.client_install`; they are not committed. The
# installer replaces the line below with the generated module files.
Installation.lua
Loader.lua
# @modules@
Harness.lua
